  "install_text": "**SM-W Lite**\n\nSingle-phase energy meter for monitoring electrical parameters.\n\n**Measured Parameters**\n- Active/Reactive/Apparent Power\n- Voltage (V)\n- Current (A)\n- Power Factor\n- Phase Angle (°)\n- Frequency (Hz)\n- Active Energy Consumption/Generation (kWh)\n- Device Temperature (°C)\n- Wi-Fi Signal Strength (dBm)\n\nThe device transmits a JSON object with 13 fields. All values are sent as strings.",
